What:		/config/usb-gadget/gadget/functions/uac2.name
Date:		Sep 2014
KernelVersion:	3.18
Description:
		The attributes:

		=========  ============================
		c_chmask   capture channel mask
		c_srate    capture sampling rate
		c_ssize    capture sample size (bytes)
		p_chmask   playback channel mask
		p_srate    playback sampling rate
		p_ssize    playback sample size (bytes)
		=========  ============================

What:		/sys/class/sound/card*/function_name
Date:		August 2026
Description:
		Read-only configfs UAC2 function-instance name associated with the
		ALSA card. The value is an exact name such as ``uac2.mic0``.
		The attribute is absent for non-configfs and non-UAC2 cards.
